        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=4,\\ b=2$",
          "worked": "Multiply the second equation by $2$, then subtract it from the first.\n$$\\begin{align*}4a-10b&=-4\\\\(4a+3b)-(4a-10b)&=22-(-4)\\\\13b&=26\\\\b&=2\\\\2a-10&=-2\\\\2a&=8\\\\a&=4\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $4(4)+3(2)=22$ and $2(4)-5(2)=-2$.",
