          "worked": "Multiply the first equation by $7$ and the second by $4$, then subtract the second result from the first.\n$$\\begin{align*}35a+28b&=112\\\\12a+28b&=20\\\\(35a+28b)-(12a+28b)&=112-20\\\\23a&=92\\\\a&=4\\\\20+4b&=16\\\\4b&=-4\\\\b&=-1\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $5(4)+4(-1)=16$ and $3(4)+7(-1)=5$.",
